{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":169172,"duration_api_ms":171014,"num_turns":33,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1a2af5ba-589d-4b14-9345-6acb6a9cf0dd","total_cost_usd":1.52413335,"usage":{"input_tokens":25,"cache_creation_input_tokens":83192,"cache_read_input_tokens":1653984,"output_tokens":5610,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":83192,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":25,"outputTokens":5610,"cacheReadInputTokens":1653984,"cacheCreationInputTokens":83192,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.4873170000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":1169,"cacheReadInputTokens":26501,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22649,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.03681635,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"summary":"Reviewed all changes across 36 files for the stage-structured shrimp model and plant trimming action split. Found 3 real bugs (2 causing test failures, 1 latent constant mismatch), plus the test failures confirm shipped code is not passing its own test suite.","amendments":[{"body":"FIX: SUB_ADULT_FEEDING_WEIGHT is defined as 0.65 in crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs:148 but 0.67 in crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs:15. The shrimp.rs constant is the one used by the actual simulation (feeding, condition, mortality). The biology.rs constant is used by public API methods feeding_units(), add_reserve_by_feeding_units(). These must be unified to a single source-of-truth constant to prevent silent divergence when the public API is called.","rationale":"This is a correctness bug. Two different modules define the same logical constant with different values (0.65 vs 0.67). The biology.rs methods are currently not called externally, but they are public API and intended for use. Any future caller of feeding_units() or add_reserve_by_feeding_units() will get different behavior than the simulation, breaking reserve distribution and budget accounting."},{"body":"FIX: Test reserve_funds_juvenile_maturation_before_dissolved_pools (crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs:258) sets state.animal.adult.reserve_g but the juvenile_to_subadult transition now funds growth from state.animal.juvenile.reserve_g (shrimp.rs juvenile_to_subadult calls fund_live_shrimp_biomass(&mut state.animal.juvenile.reserve_g, ...)). The test must place the reserve in juvenile.reserve_g for the juvenile to have enough reserve to mature. This test currently FAILS.","rationale":"This is a shipped test failure. The refactor changed maturation to fund from the maturing stage's own reserve pool rather than a shared pool, but this test was not updated to match. Running `cargo test reserve_funds_juvenile_maturation` confirms the assertion at line 263 fails (adult.count is 0, expected 1)."},{"body":"FIX: Test trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers (crates/tank_core/tests/budget_helpers.rs:242-266) asserts N/C conservation for TrimPlantsAndRemove, but the whole purpose of that action variant is to EXPORT biomass from the system. The test should either: (a) use TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings instead (which is the conserving variant), or (b) assert that total N/C decreases by exactly the exported amount. Additionally, line 259 searches for budget label 'action:trim_plants' which likely doesn't match the actual label 'action:trim_plants_and_remove'. This test currently FAILS.","rationale":"This is a shipped test failure. Running `cargo test trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers` confirms failure: nitrogen budget shows -38.5 mg imbalance from the intentional export. The test was written for the old TrimPlants (which was closed-loop) and not updated for the new export semantics."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ec677209-b58e-4934-91d0-4b3f854d2985"}
